<title>USA: Brazil's coffee areas free of damaging cold - WSC.</title>
<headline>Brazil's coffee areas free of damaging cold - WSC.</headline>
<text>
<p>LEXINGTON, Mass., Aug 4 - No damaging cold is in sight for Brazil's coffee areas over the next five days days, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation said on Monday.</p>
<p>A few possible light showers are forecast for southern areas Monday and in the north on Tuesday. Low temperatures are put at 48-64 degrees F.</p>
<p>The outlook is for mostly fair and seasonable weather Wednesday-Friday.</p>
<p>Some cooler weather could develop during the middle of next week but no damaging cold is indicated.</p>
</text>
